---
import WithPlanets from '../components/WithPlanets.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<WithPlanets>
		<h1>Tools</h1>
		<a href=".">Back to home</a>
		<p> I use a variety of tools to get my work done. </p>
		<ul>
			<li>This site was made with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>.</li>
			<li>I use <a href="https://neovim.io">Neovim</a> to write code.</li>
			<li><a href="https://archlinux.org">Arch Linux</a> is my OS of choice.</li>
			<li>I use <a href="https://github.com/typst/typst">Typst</a> for documents.</li>
			<li><a href="https://www.jj-vcs.dev/latest/">Jujutsu</a> is what I use for version control.</li>
			<li>And when I need to do research, I use <a href="https://zk-org.github.io/zk/">zk</a>.</li>
		</ul>
	</WithPlanets>
</Layout>
